      "content": "请使用中文回复，除非用户明确使用其他语言。\n\n这是一个邮件，我写了一个推荐信，帮我回复这个邮件： 发件人：Christine Chan <***@***>\n发送日期：2026-08-28 14:52:24\n收件人：\"***@***\" <***@***>\n抄送人：Kery Ng <***@***>\n主题：RE: HKU - Reference for Ms HE Yuqing\n\n\nDear Ms Zhang\n\nMy email below may have escaped your attention. I would be grateful if you could provide us with a reference letter for Ms He.\n\nMany thanks for your assistance.\n\nRegards\nChristine\n\n \n\nFrom: Christine Chan\nSent: Thursday, August 20, 2026 4:34 PM\nTo: 'y撤销***@***' <***@***>\n\nCc: Roy Tran <***@***>; Kery Ng <***@***>\nSubject: HKU - Reference for Ms HE Yuqing\nImportance: High\n\n \n\nDear Ms Zhang\n\n \n\nGreetings.  We are writing to you as Ms HE Yuqing has named you as her referee in her application for the post of Teaching Assistant in the Faculty of Education.\n\n \n\nShe has now been selected for the said position, and accordingly I write to invite you to provide us with a reference letter commenting on her research, teaching and administrative capabilities.  Please rest assured that your assessment will be kept in strictest confidence and in compliance with the local Personal Data (Privacy) Ordinance which safeguards your anonymity.  We hope that with this assurance you will be able to provide an open and frank letter of your impression of the applicant.\n\n \n\nTo give you some background information, the requirements of this position are extracted below:\n\n \n\n“Applicants should possess a Bachelor’s degree in Psychology, Information Technologies, Education, or a related field. Those with teaching experience and familiar with the CCC courses at HKU are highly preferable.\n\n \n\nThe appointee will assist the course coordinator in the teaching of the CCC course CCST9076, conducting small-group tutorials, marking assignments, preparing materials, supervising student work, co-grading all final assignments according to the course requirements, and undertaking related tasks as assigned.\"\n\n \n\nIt would be most appreciated if you could provide us with a reference letter on or before August 27, 2026, so that we can proceed with the recruitment as early as possible.  Your confidential reference letter can be addressed to Professor Yang Rui, Dean and Chairperson of the Faculty Human Resource Committee, and can be sent to me by email (***@***).\n\n \n\nWe thank you in advance for your kind assistance.\n\n \n\nRegards\n\nChristine\n\n\n\n******************************************\n\nChristine CHAN (Ms)\n\nExecutive Assistant\n\nHuman Resources (Academic Staff)\n\nFaculty of Education\n\nThe University of Hong Kong\n\nRoom 420, 4/F, Meng Wah Complex,\n\nPokfulam Road, Hong Kong SAR\n\nTel: (852) 3917 8003 Fax: (852) 2517 0075\n\n******************************************",
